<!-- ================== SECTION 10: REVIEWS ================== -->
<section class="reviews">
  <div class="reviews-inner">
    <div class="reviews-head">
      <div>
        <div class="section-eyebrow">3,086 verified reviews</div>
        <h2 class="section-h2">
          What people say<br>
          <span class="italic-word">after</span> the first month.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="reviews-stats">
        <div class="reviews-stats-big">4.6<small>/ 5</small></div>
        <div class="reviews-stats-stars">
          <svg><use href="#star"/></svg>
          <svg><use href="#star"/></svg>
          <svg><use href="#star"/></svg>
          <svg><use href="#star"/></svg>
          <svg><use href="#star"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="reviews-stats-sub">Independent · Trustpilot & on-site verified</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mobile-swipe-hint">Swipe</div>
    <div class="reviews-grid">
      <div class="review-card">
        <div class="review-card-head">
          <div class="review-avatar" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c4a57b, #8b6a47);">J</div>
          <div>
            <div class="review-meta-name">James B.</div>
            <div class="review-meta-sub">Age 38 · With Lio since 2024</div>
          </div>
          <div class="review-stars">
            <svg><use href="#star"/></svg><svg><use href="#star"/></svg><svg><use href="#star"/></svg><svg><use href="#star"/></svg><svg><use href="#star"/></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="review-body">
          "I haven't come across something as good as this. <span class="highlight">Nothing comes out, so I can use it anywhere.</span> I'm adding a few more years to my life."
        </div>
        <div class="review-foot">
          <div class="review-verified">Verified</div>
          <span>Cinnamon · 4 months in</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="review-card">
        <div class="review-card-head">
          <div class="review-avatar" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8b4a0, #b07d6d);">A</div>
          <div>
            <div class="review-meta-name">Anna K.</div>
            <div class="review-meta-sub">Age 60 · With Lio since 2025</div>
          </div>
          <div class="review-stars">
            <svg><use href="#star"/></svg><svg><use href="#star"/></svg><svg><use href="#star"/></svg><svg><use href="#star"/></svg><svg><use href="#star"/></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="review-body">
          "I've had the habit for thirty years. One week in, loving it — <span class="highlight">I'm not craving at all.</span> No chemicals. Just flavored air. Really good."
        </div>
        <div class="review-foot">
          <div class="review-verified">Verified</div>
          <span>Minty · 1 week in</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="review-card">
        <div class="review-card-head">
          <div class="review-avatar" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #9ab8d1, #5a7896);">A</div>
          <div>
            <div class="review-meta-name">Achmed R.</div>
            <div class="review-meta-sub">Age 43 · With Lio since 2024</div>
          </div>
          <div class="review-stars">
            <svg><use href="#star"/></svg><svg><use href="#star"/></svg><svg><use href="#star"/></svg><svg><use href="#star"/></svg><svg><use href="#star"/></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="review-body">
          "It blows my mind that something this <span class="highlight">simple</span> hasn't existed forever. Genuinely an awesome product. I recommend it highly."
        </div>
        <div class="review-foot">
          <div class="review-verified">Verified</div>
          <span>Fruity · 6 months in</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="review-card">
        <div class="review-card-head">
          <div class="review-avatar" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #94fca9, #4fb36a);">A</div>
          <div>
            <div class="review-meta-name">Antonio L.</div>
            <div class="review-meta-sub">Age 62 · With Lio since 2024</div>
          </div>
          <div class="review-stars">
            <svg><use href="#star"/></svg><svg><use href="#star"/></svg><svg><use href="#star"/></svg><svg><use href="#star"/></svg><svg><use href="#star"/></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="review-body">
          "The toughest part was the movement — the hand reaching. <span class="highlight">This little gadget saved me.</span> I just need my little Lio."
        </div>
        <div class="review-foot">
          <div class="review-verified">Verified</div>
          <span>Cinnamon · 3 weeks in</span>
