            <svg><use href="#star"/></svg><svg><use href="#star"/></svg><svg><use href="#star"/></svg><svg><use href="#star"/></svg><svg><use href="#star"/></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="review-body">
          "Day 14 now and honestly it's been helping me. I gave this a shot — <span class="highlight">it's the only thing that's ever helped.</span> Really good product."
        </div>
        <div class="review-foot">
          <div class="review-verified">Verified</div>
          <span>Minty · 2 weeks in</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="review-card">
        <div class="review-card-head">
          <div class="review-avatar" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a8c4a0, #5e8a56);">K</div>
